# LTNT — environment configuration (copy to .env; ALL keys are OPTIONAL)
#
# The MVP runs fully LOCALLY on your own GPU with NO API keys — generation,
# latent explore/cluster, the "make more" breeding loop, the create-map atlas,
# and the persistent Board all use local flow-matching models from your HF cache.
#
# NEVER commit your filled-in .env. (.env is gitignored; this .example is the template.)

# --- HuggingFace (only needed for GATED models: FLUX.1-dev, SD3.5) ---
# HF_TOKEN=                 # your HF access token (accept the model licenses first)
# HF_HOME=~/.cache/huggingface

# --- Local model resolution (self-hosting) ---
# On a normal machine HF_HOME is enough; on clusters with flaky offline
# resolution, stage the snapshot locally and point an explicit *_LOCAL_PATH at it.
# FLUX_LOCAL_PATH=/path/to/models--black-forest-labs--FLUX.1-dev/snapshots/<rev>
# KREA_LOCAL_PATH=/path/to/models--krea--Krea-2-Raw/snapshots/<rev>

# --- Server ---
# CORS_ALLOW_ALL=1         # set when the frontend is served from a different origin
